\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\f0\fs32\lang9 CorePro SEO Keyword Planner Tool Documentation\par
\b0\fs22\par
\b 1. Overview:\b0\par
An internal backend Node.js script that connects to the Google Ads API to fetch keyword ideas and search volumes to improve our company's SEO strategy.\par
\par
\b 2. Technical Architecture:\b0\par
Built with Node.js and the "google-ads-api" library. Authenticated via OAuth2 desktop app flow.\par
\par
\b 3. Core Features:\b0\par
The script takes seed keywords related to our business (e.g. "concrete cutting"), sends a request to the KeywordPlanIdeaService, and exports the metrics (search volume, competition) to a local JSON file for analysis by our SEO team.\par
\par
\b 4. Audience & Access:\b0\par
The tool runs locally and is strictly for internal use by our marketing employees.\par
